## Solution

```sql
WITH unique_sessions AS (
    SELECT DISTINCT
        user_id,
        session_date::date AS session_date
    FROM sessions
)

SELECT
    s.user_id,
    s.session_date,
    COUNT(o.order_id) AS total_orders,
    SUM(o.order_value) AS total_order_value
FROM unique_sessions s
JOIN order_summary o
    ON s.user_id = o.user_id
    AND s.session_date = o.order_date::date
GROUP BY
    s.user_id,
    s.session_date
ORDER BY
    s.user_id;
```

